original_text: ['All creatures able to block Prized Unicorn do so.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, draw a card.', 'Bombard deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Cast this spell only if a creature is attacking you.\\nCreate three 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', 'Create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to two plus the number of cards named Goblin Gathering in your graveyard.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Deathtouch', 'Defender\\nWhen Wall of Runes enters the battlefield, scry 1.', 'Destroy target creature with power 2 or less.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Double strike', 'Double strike\\nWhenever Goring Ceratops attacks, other creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has lifelink and "Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature."', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Waterknot enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Flash', 'Flash\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +5/+5 and has trample.', 'Flying', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, trample\\nWhenever Demon of Loathing deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if an opponent lost life this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Savage Gorger. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'Flying\\nCreature spells with flying you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Flying\\nIf you would gain life, you gain that much life plus 1 instead.\\nAngel of Vitality gets +2/+2 as long as you have 25 or more life.', "Flying\\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", 'Flying\\nOther creatures you control with flying get +1/+0.', 'Flying\\nWhen Cloudkin Seer enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Flying\\nWhen Immortal Phoenix dies, return it to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nWhen Riddlemaster Sphinx enters the battlefield, you may return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Siege Dragon enters the battlefield, destroy all Walls your opponents control.\\nWhenever Siege Dragon attacks, if defending player controls no Walls, it deals 2 damage to each creature without flying that player controls.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature with flying attacks, you may draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control attack, they gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Haste', 'Lifelink\\nWhen Charmed Stray enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control named Charmed Stray.', 'Other Goblins you control get +1/+1.\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Destroy target artifact.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Untap that creature.', 'Reduce to Ashes deals 5 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', "Soulhunter Rakshasa can't block.\\nWhen Soulhunter Rakshasa enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand, it deals 1 damage to target opponent for each Swamp you control.", "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Tap all creatures your opponents control. Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', 'Target blocking or blocked creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Scry 1.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. It gets an additional -1/-1 until end of turn for each card named Compound Fracture in your graveyard.', "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Target creature you control gets +0/+3 and gains hexproof until end of turn.', 'Target player draws seven cards.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nInescapable Blaze deals 6 damage to any target.", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a creature with flying.\\nDraw two cards.', 'Trample', 'Trample\\nWhen Baloth Packhunter enters the battlefield, put two +1/+1 counters on each other creature you control named Baloth Packhunter.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Rampaging Brontodon attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each land you control.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance, reach', "When Affectionate Indrik enters the battlefield, you may have it fight target creature you don't control.", 'When Generous Stray enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Goblin Gang Leader enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'When Octoprophet enters the battlefield, scry 2.', 'When Skeleton Archer enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Spiritual Guardian enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'Whenever Leonin Warleader attacks, create two 1/1 white Cat creature tokens with lifelink that are tapped and attacking.', 'Whenever Tin Street Cadet becomes blocked, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', 'Whenever World Shaper attacks, you may mill three cards.\\nWhen World Shaper dies, return all land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Malakir Cullblade.', 'Whenever a creature with flying enters the battlefield under your control, Waterkin Shaman gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature you control with power 2 or less attacks, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature is attacking.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, that creature gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Hallowed Priest.', 'You draw two cards and each opponent discards two cards. Each player loses 2 life.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{W}: Moorland Inquisitor gains first strike until end of turn.', '{3}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Jungle Delver.', "{5}{U}{U}: Frilled Sea Serpent can't be blocked this turn.", '{6}{B}: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', '{R}: Molten Ravager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color. If you control a creature with power 4 or greater, add two mana of any one color instead.', '{T}: Add {G}.', "{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: You gain 1 life.']
original_type: ['Artifact', 'Basic Land — Forest', 'Basic Land — Island', 'Basic Land — Mountain', 'Basic Land — Plains', 'Basic Land — Swamp', 'Creature — Angel', 'Creature — Badger', 'Creature — Beast', 'Creature — Bird', 'Creature — Bird Wizard', 'Creature — Cat', 'Creature — Cat Demon', 'Creature — Cat Soldier', 'Creature — Centaur Scout', 'Creature — Demon', 'Creature — Dinosaur', 'Creature — Djinn', 'Creature — Dragon', 'Creature — Drake', 'Creature — Elemental', 'Creature — Elemental Shaman', 'Creature — Elemental Wizard', 'Creature — Elephant Soldier', 'Creature — Elf Druid', 'Creature — Elf Scout', 'Creature — Elf Warrior', 'Creature — Frog', 'Creature — Goblin', 'Creature — Goblin Berserker', 'Creature — Goblin Rogue', 'Creature — Goblin Warrior', 'Creature — Human Cleric', 'Creature — Human Rogue', 'Creature — Human Soldier', 'Creature — Human Warrior', 'Creature — Merfolk', 'Creature — Merfolk Shaman', 'Creature — Merfolk Warrior', 'Creature — Minotaur', 'Creature — Nightmare Horse', 'Creature — Octopus', 'Creature — Ogre Warrior', 'Creature — Orc Warrior', 'Creature — Phoenix', 'Creature — Plant', 'Creature — Rat', 'Creature — Serpent', 'Creature — Skeleton', 'Creature — Skeleton Archer', 'Creature — Sphinx', 'Creature — Spider', 'Creature — Spirit', 'Creature — Turtle', 'Creature — Unicorn', 'Creature — Vampire', 'Creature — Vampire Warrior', 'Creature — Wall', 'Creature — Zombie', 'Enchantment', 'Enchantment — Aura', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Sorcery']
